meta {
  name: Checkout
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/checkout
}

docs {
  Shops, fulfilment options, fees and the **full text** of every policy the
  buyer is about to accept — the seller's own, and MonaFind's minimum refund
  rule beside it.

  An app must show these before placing an order. The order records which
  versions were on screen, and that record is what settles a dispute two years
  later when the seller has rewritten their policy three times.
}
